  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OPCW Ukraine Assistance Project through Trust Fund Article X</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OPCW has established a fund for voluntary contributions from member states, under Article X (Assistance and Protection). The fund can be used for the acquisition of equipment (masks and detection equipment) and training for protection and detection of the use of chemicals.  Norad will contribute to the OPCW Ukraine Assistance Project through the trust fund for the implementation of Article X.</narrative>
  </description>
